sequenceDiagram
  actor Student
  participant UI as NuclearShield UI
  participant API as Evidence API
  participant Analyzer
  participant Audit
  Student->>UI: Choose synthetic evidence
  UI->>API: POST read-only CSV or JSON
  API->>API: Validate and hash
  API->>Analyzer: Analyze declared baselines
  Analyzer-->>API: Explained findings
  API->>Audit: Append evidence digest and summary
  API-->>UI: Render findings
  Student->>UI: Open HTML report
  UI->>API: GET report
  API-->>Student: Synthetic safeguards report

